From a98d1726bf3d39b6eccf37c4f59ebab9d5c29a4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: genspark_dev <genspark_dev@genspark.ai>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 01:56:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Run the suite on every push, and check the metadata against
 itself

Nothing ran automatically before this: the framework-light suite was only ever run by
hand. Add CI over it, plus a standalone metadata validator that also runs locally.

The validator immediately paid for itself, catching six report definitions missing
report_name and disabled, and ten redundant translation rows, two of which carried
conflicting Arabic for the same term. Fix all of it so the check starts green.

Add the read-only site script for what needs a migrated database: transition tasks
enabled and not asynchronous, reports carrying roles, hooks resolving.
